rry lethal attacks unarmed, and in 2e I legitimately can't name a rule that says you *cant* apply defence against lethal attacks unarmed. <br /> <br /> So, uh, basically, in either edition, the rule would seem to be 'describe it'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1596-horngeek","name":"horngeek","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"241"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-08T15:34:47-08:00","id":1183729,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1183695-the-bare-handed-blade-block?p=1183708#post1183708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmmmm. I'd Say the Epix Dexterity is the way to go.</div> </div> </div> </div>For blocking a sword with your bare hand? That sounds like an Epic Stamina thing","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-08T16:00:53-08:00","id":1183746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1183695-the-bare-handed-blade-block?p=1183729#post1183729\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For blocking a sword with your bare hand? That sounds like an Epic Stamina thing</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Yes, this is my question.<br /> <br /> because strenght can fits well too, to have the strenght to stop a blade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-08T18:46:49-08:00","id":1183789,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElanConnor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1183695-the-bare-handed-blade-block?p=1183746#post1183746\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Yes, this is my question.<br /> <br /> because strenght can fits well too, to have the strenght to stop a blade.</div> </div> </div> </div>Though Horngeek makes a good point. What edition are you talking about? In 1e, you just need to jazz up the description of your block. In 2e, there doesn't need to really be a reason you can't do it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-08T20:34:17-08:00","id":1183815,"title":"","content":"Fundamentally, unless you're trying to disarm your opponent as well, this is... basically a stunt, in the description sense rather than the Storypath sense. It's not the sort of thing I'd require a feat or Knack or Boon for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1596-horngeek","name":"horngeek","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"241"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T07:46:28-08:00","id":1183927,"title":"","content":"talking about 2E<br /> <br /> let's say that: a giant skeleton samurai is slowy crushing his ancient but giant blade on me <br /> <br /> What attribute should have my character to bare hand block the blade?? (and wich epic should have)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T09:55:55-08:00","id":1183981,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElanConnor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1183695-the-bare-handed-blade-block?p=1183927#post1183927\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">talking about 2E<br /> <br /> let's say that: a giant skeleton samurai is slowy crushing his ancient but giant blade on me<br /> <br /> What attribute should have my character to bare hand block the blade?? (and wich epic should have)</div> </div> </div> </div>I think your defense will be rolled using your highest Physical Attribute (or your highest Resilience, but I've seen Neall say the highest Physical).<br /> <br /> If you manage to accumulate more successes on defense (say through the Full Defense action) to block the giant sword, then congrats, be awesome.<br /> <br /> As for knowing what Epic to have... Search me. We don't actually know what the bonuses or Boons of the Epic Attributes are yet. Those are in Heroes.<br /> <br /> But if say, the giant skeleton only accumulates say, 3 successes on his attack even counting Scale, and you manage to pump your Defense up to like 5 with a good rolled Defense. At that point, you manage to defend, and your GM will probably agree that you can say you just caught that sword over your head, like a freaking champion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T10:24:32-08:00","id":1183996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1183695-the-bare-handed-blade-block?p=1183981#post1183981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think your defense will be rolled using your highest Physical Attribute (or your highest Resilience, but I've seen Neall say the highest Physical).<br /> <br /> If you manage to accumulate more successes on defense (say through the Full Defense action) to block the giant sword, then congrats, be awesome.<br /> <br /> As for knowing what Epic to have... Search me. We don't actually know what the bonuses or Boons of the Epic Attributes are yet. Those are in Heroes.<br /> <br /> But if say, the giant skeleton only accumulates say, 3 successes on his attack even counting Scale, and you manage to pump your Defense up to like 5 with a good rolled Defense. At that point, you manage to defend, and your GM will probably agree that you can say you just caught that sword over your head, like a freaking champion.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> fuck yeah.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}